  "description": "Jansno X60 Electric Bike Equipped with Dual Motors and Hydraulic Brakes, 23Ah large battery has a range of up to 80 KM\n\nThe Jansno X60 is a high-performance fat tire electric bike built to handle everything from daily commutes to off-road adventures. Powered by dual 750W brushless motors (total 1500W), this beast of a bike delivers unmatched power, speed, and climbing ability across various terrains including city roads, mountain trails, snow, and sand.\n\nDual 750W Hub Motors\nExperience superior acceleration and torque with front and rear 750W motors for a total output of 1500W.\n\nLong-Range 48V 23Ah Battery\nEquipped with a high-capacity removable lithium battery offering up to 52km (pure electric) and up to 80km (pedal assist) per charge.\n\nAll-Terrain 20x4.0” Fat Tires\nConquer rough roads, gravel, snow, and sand with wide, shock-absorbing tires designed for maximum grip and stability.\n\nHydraulic Disc Brakes\nEnsures responsive and reliable stopping power in all weather conditions.\n\nDual Suspension System\nFront and rear shock absorbers make every ride smoother, even on rugged terrain.\n\nSmart LCD Display\nStay informed with real-time stats including speed, battery level, distance, and pedal assist mode.\n\nHigh Payload Capacity\nSupports riders up to 150kg (330 lbs) – perfect for carrying cargo or commuting with gear.\n\nWhether you're looking for power, comfort, or versatility, the Jansno X60 delivers. It's the ultimate e-bike for riders who want to go further, faster, and beyond the pavement.",
